Task: Configure ESLint and Prettier for the monorepo-style structure

Summary:
Established comprehensive code quality tooling for the Electron + React + TypeScript project, covering all process types (Main, Preload, Renderer) with appropriate linting rules and formatting standards.

Files Created:
- .prettierrc - Prettier configuration with project formatting standards
